notes               = "Untitled in source. The latest-dated poem in this stretch by two years — ۱۳۷۰/۹/۲۷ is 18 December 1991, where pages 91–109 are ۱۳۶۸–۱۳۶۹, so page 90 sits out of date order in an otherwise chronological book. Worth confirming against the photograph. The three 'I do not know' lines share one predicate in Persian (چه رازی دارد arrives only at the end of the third), which English has to distribute or postpone. Imported as a draft with machine / lantern layers; ===translation=== left for Ben."
